<v Ira Glass>[赞助商致谢]

00:58:30.340 --> 00:58:38.190
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Mr. Torey Malatia. Every time he wanders by my office or I pass him in the hall, I can hear him mumbling to himself.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ 的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责。每次他经过我的办公室或我在走廊经过他时，我都能听到他在自言自语。

00:58:38.190 --> 00:58:46.810
<v Stephanie>OK, I just got a big chill. I have a definite male presence right there. I don't want anybody to move.
<v Stephanie>OK，我刚才感觉到一阵恶寒。我感觉到那里有一个明确的男性存在。我不希望任何人动。

00:58:46.810 --> 00:58:55.390
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:55.390 --> 00:59:00.390
